# 换行归一：仓库内一律 LF，工作区按平台；二进制明确标记防误改
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.db binary
*.exe binary

# vendored libs must byte-match node_modules on every platform (sfc-gate compares them)
assets/vendor-lib/* binary
pickdone/assets/vendor-lib/* binary
